-- Hampshire Dining Commons

Why it matters: it was the first dining hall renovation in the country to earn LEED Gold, and its menu is built around sustainability too: minimally processed food, more plant-based dishes picked at peak season, less red meat, and more sustainable seafood.', 42.3838556, -72.5305165, NULL, false)
