-- Worcester Commons

How it saves energy: most south- and west-facing windows use electrochromic glass, which tints itself in strong sun to keep the building cooler, and energy recovery systems reuse heat that would otherwise be exhausted from the kitchens.', 42.3932564, -72.5251071, NULL, false)
ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
-- New2U Thrift Store

Why it matters: New2U has kept more than 100,000 pounds of usable items out of the landfill since 2014. Each fall''s one-day Move-In Tag Sale resells the move-out haul; the 11th, on September 5, 2026, took in more than $25,000, which pays for the store and its student staff.

How to take part: drop small donations in the box in the Hampden lobby on weekdays, or volunteer a shift.', 42.3828969, -72.5296958, NULL, false)
